  "aiContextParagraph": "As the 2027 general elections approach, President Bola Tinubu and the All Progressives Congress (APC) are intensifying political engagement across Nigeria. Recent activities include a major North-East zonal rally in Maiduguri, where security measures have been increased for the presidential visit. Concurrently, political groups and government officials are engaged in various outreach efforts, including door-to-door mobilizations, meetings with religious and community leaders, and attempts to garner support from diverse regional factions. President Tinubu has also reflected on the historical struggle for democracy in Nigeria, encouraging citizens to uphold those values. While supporters emphasize the administration's achievements and electoral prospects, opposition figures have expressed criticism regarding the political outlook for various APC candidates in the upcoming cycle. These activities represent the ongoing efforts by the ruling party to consolidate support structures ahead of the national polls.",
